{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "octabam-quantizer",
 "version": "363861e",
 "title": "SCALE QUANTIZER",
 "description": "PROJECT > CONTROL > SEQUENCER > SCALE: the PTCH knob and CHROMATIC trig keys quantize to a scale (24 scales, OFF = stock); > ROOT: the note the scale is built on (C..B; key 1 of the CHROMATIC keyboard sounds it); > GLIDE: the synth's glide time (OFF, 1..127; the legato switch is the synth track's LEG setting); polyphonic chromatic keys on a synth track whose VOIC is 2..4; on a synth track PTCH is semitones (-64..+63) and the CHROMATIC octave runs -4..+4. (octabam module quantizer, converted from 363861e)",
 "category": "Machines and the sequencer",
 "author": "timhastie/octatrick-modules",
 "license": "MIT",
 "target": {
  "device": "octatrack",
  "product": "Octatrack",
